e Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T06:15:56-07:00","id":1256081,"title":"","content":"What animal seems appropriate for full plate armor and a two-handed axe?<br /> <br /> I\u2019m thinking Tyrant Lizard. Maybe with a capstone where you roar to inflict people with pants-shitting terror, because I don\u2019t have a better idea.<br /> <br /> Even without the axe, you could knock someone down, pin them with one foot, and stomp or kick them with the other. If you have the axe, you hold them down and chop them.<br /> <br /> I can\u2019t think of a single Charm or Evocation in the game thus far that interacts with a chopping attack. Plenty that interact with smashing attacks.<br /> <br /> White Reaper uses spears and scythes, which both have the piercing tag, but it doesn\u2019t do anything with it. At least the Tusk of Ga-Malech does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T06:31:54-07:00","id":1256088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1235425-what-animal-styles-do-you-want-to-see?p=1256010#p